Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1945年和1962年之间 美国进行了331次空爆核弹试验
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天 美国政府仍然 否认核辐射灰尘会造成基因变化
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新墨西哥州沙漠）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！救命 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蛋糕做好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cake is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了 大家都上场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for the show. Everybody on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:59.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,《隔山有眼》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.65,0:06:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你的话 丘比特 我有大个的枪子儿喂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's you, Jupiter, I got some buckshot for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你我不干了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关我事！你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out! Ya hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看着办吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我真受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I can't do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 外面象火炉一样 - 宝贝你应该呆在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah! It's hot out here. - Honey, you ought to stay in the car out of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 我总得活动一下筋骨 - 怎么一个人都没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, honey, I have to stretch my legs. - Where the hell is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人吗？- 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来吧 笨蛋 - 鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up, jackass. - Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加满油 再检查一下机油 老兄 - 好 马上就来 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fill her up and check the fluids, my friend. - Oh, yeah. Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美女 野兽 住口！- 啊！他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beauty, Beast, stop it! - Ah! Ah! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再告诉我一遍为什么我们 不能象正常人那样做飞机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me again why we couldn't fly like normal people? Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 原来是他们不让你爸开飞机 - 道格 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They wouldn't let your dad drive the plane. - Doug, relax, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们的银婚纪念 你能来他们很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's their silver anniversary, and they're so happy you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你父母看不惯我 - 不对 你错了 他们喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your parents can't stand me. - Nope, you're wrong. They love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以带他们去海上环游的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have taken them on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴好不好？我从来没有要求过你什么 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what? Stop. I never ask you for anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想等我们银婚纪念的时候 凯瑟琳来了你会多高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think how happy you'll be when Catherine comes along on our 25th, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 没有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个烂车里面我才不会高兴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna be in a fucking trailer home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一带的旅游者不多见 你们要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't see too many travelers around here. Where y'all headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣地亚哥 - 加利福尼亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- San Diego. - California?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 这条路够绕远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. - Sure didn't take the fastest road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 我们是要看沙漠风光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. We absolutely had to see the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是不是 鲍勃？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didrt we, Bob? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠里什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothir to see in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？你听到了 亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Did you hear that, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道在加油泵边上 吸烟是违法的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know it's illegal to smoke around a gas pump?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.21,0:10:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来过来小乖猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come on. He's a good little piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小乖猪 小乖猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little baby piggy. Little baby piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 过来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, come over here. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 真不常见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. That's so random.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩真是天生一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two make a perfect pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.67,0:11:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你干什么？别在那尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing? Don't pee there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管得太宽了吧？转过头去我马上就完\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you care? Just turn around for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你难道没有看到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hello. Don't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受不了这种热浪的 我告诉过你要用棉布的尿布\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so uncomfortable in this heat. I told you to use cloth diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 医生说这些尿布也很好 - 看她的小脸蛋儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom, the doctor said these were fine. - Look at those little cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 亲爱的 - 是的 她没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know, sweetheart. - Yes, she is. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她是又饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's getting hungry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.81,0:12:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你知道哪有电话能用吗？我的手机收不到信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, excuse me. Do you have a phone I can use? I can't get a signal out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 布科斯基 你就别玩手机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bukowski. Give the cell phone a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 鲍勃 这是工作电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Bob. Duty calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 从我们一出发 你就抱着手机讲个没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you've been on the phone since we left, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我已经出来两天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sweetheart, I've been gone two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.83,0:12:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要保证我的店一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to make sure that my store's not burning to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢了 布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Brenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 布伦达？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Brenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！弄得我满手都是！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Got it all over my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到I-88公路还有多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far are we from I-88?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混蛋变态 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freaking perv. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少5或6个小时 - 你饿吗 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're at least five or six hours. - You hungry, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么我们不走圣达菲呢？- 那边太乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why couldn't we have gone through Santa Fe? - It's nasty out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 你就不能少说两句？- 如果我这么说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, could you put a cork in it for a minute? - Well, if I do say so myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你丈夫说得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, your husband here's quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的南下通往I-88的路 从这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only southbound road going to l-88. From there…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以走40号公路 但是绕远而且路面太旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take the 40 to California, but it's a long, old drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无所谓 我喜欢夜里开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't bother me a bit. I like to drive at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去15年的时间 就是夜里巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to work the night patrol for 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你是警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right? You a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 是探长 - 谢天谢地 现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, detective. - Not anymore, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在开办自己的保安公司 - 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm starting my own, uh, security firm. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是警察吗 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a cop too, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是搞通讯业的 …就是卖手机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm in telecommunications. I sell cell phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这你可找不到顾客 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't find any customers around here. - Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都正常 机油没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's fine. Oil's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女 回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty, come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy. What do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 46美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, $46 even.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 鲍勃 我来付吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, Bob, here. Let me take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还付得起油钱 布科斯基 不用找钱了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still afford the gas, Bukowski. Keep the change, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女 出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty? Come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女？出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty? Come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能帮你吗 小姐？- 哦 真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I help you, miss? - Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的狗 她出去溜哒 然后就不肯安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just our dog. She just… She got out, and she won't stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琳恩 我们要走了！- 来 小姑娘 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lynn, we're leaving! - Come on, girl. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 她总是想出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, she keeps getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 她没事了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right. I got her. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的 你能告诉他 别太急吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey? Honey? Could you, uh, tell him to take it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 热得我头晕脑涨 - 我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The heat's making me nauseous. - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Let's go. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们现在是在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we're on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图上没有标 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not on the map, but if you…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这两英里的地方 你左转上那条土路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a left at the dirt road, couple miles from here…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃 - 就可以穿过山脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. - It'll lead you through the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能省几小时的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably save you a couple ofhours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易找 在前面有很破旧的栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't miss it. Uh, there's an old fence right in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧栅栏 土路 两英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old fence, dirt road, two miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你一路平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. You have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.22,0:16:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我讨厌你唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I hate your singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别唱了！- 想像一下第一个穿越沙漠的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - Imagine the first people to cross this desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道身在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't know where they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 我明白 因为我们也不知道身在何处 - 布伦达 路就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I can, because neither do we. - Brenda, the road is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有路 路就一定通到什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It exists. It's got to go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 看看风景多好 看那岩石上的光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, look how beautiful it is. Look at the light on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真操蛋！- 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is so fucked! - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许污言秽语 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your language, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人支持我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like a little backup here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是他妈的什么事！- 嘿！管好你的臭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is such bullshit. - Hey, watch your fucking mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都冷静下来好不好？大家都累了 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just calm down here? We're all a little tired, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你难道不是60年代成长起来的吗？为什么还这么道貌岸然？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mom. Didrt you grow up in the '60s? Why are you so uptight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈才不是道貌岸然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom didn't used to be uptight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她原来可是嬉皮士 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was a little hippie chick. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是看到她象你这么大的时候 她可是个小美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen her when she was your age. She was a little hottie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 别瞎说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. - Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炎炎夏日开车穿越 新墨西哥的沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving through the New Mexico desert in the middle of summer…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里的空调还正好坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a broken air conditioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是很棒的假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你来了 要不然我就他妈的的闷死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you came because I would have been so fucking bored otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你省省力气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Give up on that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我鼓捣了一个半小时 那东西太旧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried for an hour and a half. Thing's ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线都是中世纪的 早就该换了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiring's medieval. Needs to be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是调温器的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. It's just the, uh, thermostat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,线松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 总算可以喘口气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, at least we can breathe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.57,0:19:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我以为你戒烟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I thought you quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我姐知道吗？- 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does my sister know? - Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道大块头鲍勃会很不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, Big Bob'd get pretty pissed off…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他知道你在他的新装修的 88年Airstream车里面抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he found out you were smoking in his newly renovated '88 Airstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我连他也一起操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fuck Big Bob too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 来一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Want one? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你抽了这烟 你姐非把我阉了不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister would cut my nuts off if you start smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为她很久以前就这么做了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she did that a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们是在这条蓝色路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're somewhere on this blue road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 我们不在蓝色路上 也不在其他任何路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, we're not on the blue road or any other road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人说这条路不在地图上 还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy said it wasrt on the map, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:19:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！抓紧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好孩子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的？孩子在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey? Where's the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她就在这 - 她没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's right here. - Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 没事 - 到底出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's fine. She's fine. - What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太热了 所以轮胎爆了 - 你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The heat must have caused a blowout. - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.65,0:20:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还好 还好 就是吓了一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm fine. I'm fine. I'm just a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比呢？鲍比你怎么样？有没有事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bobby? Bobby. Are you all right, honey? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原来就知道这对孩子不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this wasrt going to be safe for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么样？- 我们还好 没有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah, we're okay. We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 好了 没有事 - 老天 整个车都坏了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, okay, we're all right. - Oh, my God. The whole trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 大家来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, guys. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真倒霉透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有信号吗？- 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you find a signal? - No. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国97%的地方是手机信号覆盖区 我们就在那另外的3%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety-seven percent nationwide coverage, and we find ourselves in that three percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好 你爸要看沙漠风光 我希望这回他可以看个够\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well, your dad wanted to see the desert. I hope he's enjoying himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格 你又开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug, don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许这里有人想租个警察呢 - 道格！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe somebody will need a rent-a-cop around here. - Doug!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是一有机会就损我 难道我就不能反咬他一口？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every chance the guy gets, he takes me down a peg. Can't snap back at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你还和他一般见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, don't stoop to his level. It's my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,200度的气温！是大家的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}200 degrees out here! It's everybody's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别听他的 - 你消停一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't listen to him. - Get off my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 受损程度如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, what's the damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,轴断了 车报废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The axle is broken, and it's… totaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能修吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.77,0:21:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 车身都七扭八歪 我们不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the frame is twisted to hell. We can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用什么修？我说… - 她在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With what? I mean… - There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手机给我 我得叫个拖车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your damn cell phone. I'm gonna call a tow truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有信号 我试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signal. I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 我们可以使用无线电 - 你可以试 不过我怀疑没有人会听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, we can use the C. B. - You can try it, but I doubt you're gonna get anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速公路在山的那一边 你收不到信号的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The freeway's way the hell on the other side of those hills. You won't get a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃？你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob? What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用腿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用腿走？- 是的 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We walk? - Yep. You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在沙漠中间 无论去哪里都很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the middle of the desert. We're miles from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走的话 就守株待兔 等人开车经过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's either that, or we sit here and wait for somebody to drive by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.83,0:22:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下了高速公路以后 你看到任何人经过了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen anybody drive by since we got off the freeway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:23:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你抄近路开始 我就没有看到一个人影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen anyone drive by since you decided to take the shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 我们一起走走 好不好？- 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey. Honey, let's go for a walk. Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么都没有 你真是昏头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing there, you shitheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不错 好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Ah, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信沙漠里到处是响尾蛇 那锁好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure this desert is full of rattlesnakes. Is that locked?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.33,0:23:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 过来 - 我想是锁好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby, come here. - I think that's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 亲爱的 - 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, honey. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道 我看过…妈？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, I saw… Mom? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保险上着呢 - 是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Safety's on, boy. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.15,0:23:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看过一个关于沙漠里的蛇的纪录片 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw a documentary on desert snakes… - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在「探索」频道 有些种类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the Discovery Channel… And there's some species…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬了你的话 25分钟内人就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get bit, you can die within like 25 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我倒要看看 它们怎么对付这支枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I'd like to see how they stack up against this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.29,0:23:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那枪支要锁起来的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought those were gonna stay locked up, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.83,0:24:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你不是跟我说的 - 你没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you werert talking to me, honey. - You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 亲爱的 我是有执照的专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, honey. I'm a licensed professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.17,0:24:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 相对于你的祷告 我更信任我的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'd take my bullets over your prayers any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉 你还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.57,0:24:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么碰到蝎子 土狼什么的怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about, like, uh, scorpions and coyotes and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.18,0:24:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞美上帝 然后把子弹递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise the Lord and pass the ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 道格 你想试试吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doug. You wanna try?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！别把枪口对着我！- 别怕 保险开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, don't point that at me! - Don't worry, man. The safety's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比？- 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Bobby? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.09,0:24:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要理道格 他是民主党 他不信仰武力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave Doug alone. He's a Democrat. He doesn't believe in guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 来吧 道格 过来开一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Come on, Dougy. Come here. Just one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你感觉有力量 你可能会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes you feel kind of powerful. You might like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.57,0:24:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么想 鲍比 也许我会射到自己的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, Bobby. I'd probably just shoot my foot off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.67,0:24:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 他说得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.04,0:24:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能真会射到自己的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd probably shoot his foot off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.12,0:25:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 B - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, "B." - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.39,0:25:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.63,0:25:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真是够拽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This is a total drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.74,0:25:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你知道我才不管他们讲什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you know, I really don't care what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.07,0:25:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,明年我要和朋友们去坎昆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next year, I am going to Cancun with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.58,0:25:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不参加这种家庭旅游了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not going on any more of these little family trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们全家一起旅游的机会 没有多少了 你知道吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not gonna have many more of them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.45,0:25:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想去坎昆 你知道 你应该先找个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you want to go to Cancun, you know you're gonna have to get a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.09,0:25:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 你是说象你的工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. What, you mean like your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.79,0:25:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达 我是帮道格管理商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda, I help Doug out at the store, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.23,0:25:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.83,0:25:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你能把我的外衣拿来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey? Can you bring me myjacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.07,0:25:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就来 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.19,0:26:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.29,0:26:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.16,0:26:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能给我个糖吃吗？- 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you get me a Twinkie? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.35,0:26:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续往这个方向走 - 是 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just keep walking this direction. - Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.42,0:26:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找出这条路通向哪里 我往回找我们来的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find out where the road leads, and I'll head back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.59,0:26:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离我远点 - 好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay away from me. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.23,0:26:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是通向什么地方 也许就回到高速公路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta lead somewhere. Maybe back to the freeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.10,0:26:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也带枪吗？- 不 亲爱的 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you taking a gun too? - No, honey, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.57,0:26:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要用枪来寻找帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a gun to find help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不要这个 - 你需要带帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want this. - You need the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:26:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我头型都弄砸了 - 在这谁看你啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It gives me hat head. I don't like it. - Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又不是时装展览 - 好吧 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not about fashion. - All right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.31,0:27:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果五六英里内找不到帮助 你就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen. Uh, if you don't find help within five or six miles, just come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.58,0:27:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.02,0:27:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给 亲爱的 - 我去那加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, honey. - I'm gonna go to the gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.79,0:27:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题就是 天黑前你根本赶不回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just never gonna make it back by sunset is the only problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.19,0:27:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 才八英里而已 我会借用他的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, it's only about eight miles. I'll borrow the old mars car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.59,0:27:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,用他的电话 如果他有电话 我会在天黑前领着拖车回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use his phone, if he's got one. I'll be back with a tow truck before nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.93,0:27:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能和道格一起去吗？- 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I go with Doug? - No. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.03,0:27:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这陪你妈妈和姐姐们 嘿 布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here with your mother and your sisters. Now, hey, uh, Brenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.70,0:27:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 你要听你弟弟的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up. Your brother is in charge, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.27,0:27:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以别逗他 - 我想你出发前我们应该先祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So don't tease him. - I think we should pray before you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.77,0:27:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 妈！- 布伦达 不求你都不行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Mom! - Brenda, is it really so much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.81,0:27:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.15,0:27:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.15,0:27:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝没有人在看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God no one's watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.59,0:27:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 别闹了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - Stop it, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.62,0:27:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.26,0:27:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请赐福于我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please bless us at this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.50,0:27:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,派遣你的守护天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And send your guardian angels…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.97,0:28:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来帮助我们走出山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help us to walk through this valley in our faith…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.20,0:28:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激我们的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, yeah, with the help of thy dear Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.67,0:28:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 再见 道格 你多加小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Bye, Doug. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.28,0:28:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一会儿见 - 一会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you later. - See you guys in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.41,0:28:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 帽子要戴着 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey? Keep the hat on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.45,0:28:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴帽子？- 别装像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I wearing it? - Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.12,0:28:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到我头上的帽子了？- 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see it on my head? - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.49,0:28:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.87,0:28:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, sweetness. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.84,0:28:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不想再睡了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't want to sleep anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.11,0:28:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要把脚放在桌子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take your feet off the table. Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.08,0:28:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们露营并不意味着 你可以象猪一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because we're camping doesn't mean you get to act like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.89,0:28:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, honey, really…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该从乳房到奶瓶 换来换去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't go from the breast to the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.19,0:29:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这么大了应该习惯于其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}At her age, she should get used to one or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.16,0:29:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 多谢你的建议 不过她是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, thanks for the advice, but she's my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.30,0:29:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信在你的纪念日 我们却搁浅在鬼才知道的什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe that we're stranded in the middle of nowhere on your anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.91,0:29:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 你知道如果我们就在大路上开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm. - You know, if we just stayed on the main road…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.01,0:29:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们就到加州了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be in California right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.18,0:29:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要洗个热水澡 来一杯冰镇的玛格丽塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'd give for a hot shower and a cold margarita.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.15,0:29:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 海滩 - 做个按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The beach. - A massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.62,0:29:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就想在真的床上睡一觉 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take a real bed. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.09,0:29:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大麻 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The chronic. - The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.42,0:29:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.79,0:29:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 她说的是大麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chronic. It's pot, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 啊 谁吸大麻啊？- 是啊 到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Who smokes pot? - Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.33,0:29:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁吸大麻？- 嘿 谁看到我的红色运动衫了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who smokes pot? - Hey, has anybody seen my red sweatshirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 后座那件带帽子的？布伦达？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the hoodie thing in the backseat? Brenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是坐在上面睡觉了吗？- 我没有碰你的臭运动衫 行了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Werert you sleeping on it? - I haven't touched your smelly sweatshirt, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.08,0:29:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么狗这么激动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are the dogs so excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.58,0:29:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是附近有响尾蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's probably some rattlesnakes somewhere around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.79,0:30:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你总是提到响尾蛇 那么弗洛伊德会怎么分析你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how Freud would have interpreted your obsession with rattlesnakes, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.46,0:30:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.69,0:30:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.86,0:30:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比！闭嘴吧 - 太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby Can'ter! Stop that! - That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.46,0:30:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真不应该那么说 - 是有些恶心 我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's so wrong. - That was a little gross. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.17,0:30:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我向在座的所有人道歉 - 好了 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I apologize to the entire table. - Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.04,0:30:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴 我们能一起旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really glad that we all came on this trip together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.31,0:30:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是啊 一个大家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, that makes one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.38,0:30:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水果在哪？- 谁要什么吃的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is the, uh, fruit? - Does anyone need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.85,0:30:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.79,0:30:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 布伦达 - 真太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Hey. Brenda! - Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.55,0:30:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你搞笑吗？你知道多长时间… - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you kidding me? Do you know how long… - Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.76,0:30:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比？- 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby? - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.79,0:30:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 该吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.86,0:30:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会叫他回来的 妈 鲍比！- 总是这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get him, Mom. Bobby! - This always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 不要离开车太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I don't want you going away from the trailer right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.34,0:30:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.61,0:31:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.98,0:32:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.61,0:33:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.12,0:35:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.37,0:36:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.80,0:38:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.67,0:38:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.08,0:38:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.72,0:38:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.87,0:38:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.98,0:38:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我在你告诉我的近路上 车出了点麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, I had a bit of a wreck out on your, uh, shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.76,0:38:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.80,0:39:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿了一些水 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grabbed some water, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.61,0:39:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话坏的 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dead. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.84,0:39:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友！嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, my friend! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.18,0:39:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.62,0:39:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You home?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.45,0:40:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.46,0:40:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.23,0:41:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,变态的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.71,0:41:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.28,0:41:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,丘比特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.59,0:41:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要喂你枪子尝尝 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got buckshot, ya hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.06,0:41:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.46,0:41:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不明白这里发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.03,0:41:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.24,0:42:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.44,0:42:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在矿井里面长大 和野兽一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grew up in the mines like wild animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门 慢慢打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door, slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.58,0:42:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对孩子们来说 那是什么样的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of place is that for children?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.59,0:42:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么样的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a place is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.62,0:42:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 放下枪 轻轻地放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Put the weapon down. Put it down, easy. Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经尽我所能 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did the best I could. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.54,0:42:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.17,0:42:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.51,0:42:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.78,0:42:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.32,0:42:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.46,0:42:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸啊爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy. Oh, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.89,0:42:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.39,0:42:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.03,0:42:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.51,0:43:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁托 把枪给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give me that gun, Pluto!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.50,0:43:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他妈的枪给我！- 你过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the gosh darn gun! - Get on over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.67,0:43:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 过来 你不应该有枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Come on. You oughtrt have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.76,0:43:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.03,0:44:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦达！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenda!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.87,0:44:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这！马上就回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm here! I'll be back in a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.77,0:44:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.74,0:44:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.35,0:44:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.72,0:44:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.61,0:44:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.25,0:44:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 让我来… 亲爱的 头发都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me just… Oh, honey, the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.95,0:45:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.15,0:45:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道布伦达能发现你 是你太走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you really are so lucky that Brenda found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.12,0:45:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说如果你在外面 饥寒交迫度过一夜怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if you'd had to spend the whole night out there in the cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.53,0:45:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比不要担心 美女饿了就会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby. Don't worry. Beauty will come back when she's hungry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.17,0:45:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你试…试了无线电吗？- 根本就不好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you… Did you try the radio? - It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.47,0:45:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们听到有些 象是呼吸的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we heard something. Some sort of breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.95,0:45:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么呼吸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.85,0:45:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很怪异的 是不是 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was weird. Right, Mom? L…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.22,0:45:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得一定是静电干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it was just static.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.59,0:45:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！那听起来就象是 变态的搔扰电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! It sounded like a perverted call.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.66,0:45:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有妈妈才会在这里也接到色情电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Mom would get an obscene phone call out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.63,0:45:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! What…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.63,0:45:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的？- 不不不！你们不要出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey? - No, no, no, no! I want you guys to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.28,0:45:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.34,0:46:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽！野兽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast! Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.88,0:46:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 鲍比 - 老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Bobby. - Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.88,0:46:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！别用枪对着我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Whoa, whoa! Stop pointing the gun at me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.28,0:46:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天！鲍比你怎么… - 道格 真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus, Bobby! - Doug, I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.82,0:46:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.42,0:46:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是想吓唬你 - 我知道 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didrt mean to startle you, man. - Yeah, I know. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.46,0:46:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我发现了一个地方 你可能都不信 就象是异度空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I found this place out here. You wouldn't believe it. It's like the Twilight Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.73,0:46:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 是鲍勃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Is that Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.73,0:46:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是道格 没事 - 回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Doug. It's okay. - Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.74,0:47:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的！老天！感谢上帝你没有事！我心里一直都七上八下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey! Oh, my God! Thank God you're okay. I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.21,0:47:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 就是累坏了 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm fine. Just exhausted. Look. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.81,0:47:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我找到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all this stuff I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.81,0:47:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有一个大的火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a huge crater out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们一定是把那当垃圾场了 我以前从来没有看到过那种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}People must use it as a dump site. I've never seen anything like it in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.22,0:47:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么… - 看看这个 还是全新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are… - Look at this stuff. It's brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.22,0:47:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在沙漠里面拿着鱼竿 钓什么好呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do with a fishing pole in the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.46,0:47:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你是去找人帮忙 - 走了五英里路就到了尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you went to go find somebody. - Road dead-ends in five miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.29,0:47:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就是火山口 根本不是近路 而是沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the crater is. It's not a shortcut. It's just desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死路？- 死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It dead-ends? - Dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.97,0:47:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道那个老家伙就在胡说八道 - 希望你爸爸能比我强\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew that old man was full of shit. - Hope your dad did better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.90,0:47:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我们错过了 该拐弯的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe wejust missed a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.90,0:47:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的你们做什么饭了吗？我饿死了 - 嗯 进来吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, did you guys cook any dinner? I'm starving. - Yeah. Come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 谢谢 布伦达？- 怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. Thanks. Brenda? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.14,0:47:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的唇膏带了吗？我的嘴唇都干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have that lip balm? My lips are really dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.21,0:47:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想用吗？太恶心了 我才不让你用我的唇膏呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious? That's gross. I'm not letting you use my lip balm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.38,0:47:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是平时不告诉 就用了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you use it without telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.97,0:48:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 鲍比 别关门 我们马上就出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Bobby. Don't close that door. We're leaving in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.11,0:48:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 让你老爸休息会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Get some rest for Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.21,0:48:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不等爸爸回来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys aren't gonna wait till Dad gets back?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.21,0:48:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 鲍比 我太累了 我要睡一会儿先\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bobby, I'm exhausted. I need to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.22,0:48:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 没关系的 你睡在这儿会很舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's fine. You'll be more comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.29,0:48:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡在地板上 妈妈和布伦达到前面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sleep on the floor, and Mom and Brenda are gonna be up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.16,0:48:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和林恩睡后面 我们的睡袋足够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and Lynn can take the back. We got extra sleeping bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.59,0:48:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你想让六个人睡在 能装三个人的车里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you got six people sleeping in a three-person trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.36,0:48:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会舒服的 而且很怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not comfortable. It's a little bit weird. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.80,0:48:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 你拿水过来吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, you gonna bring the water? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.74,0:48:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 道格 我能和说句话吗？- 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, hey. Doug, Doug. Can I talk to you? - What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.44,0:48:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你来吗？- 马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby, you coming? - I'm almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.71,0:48:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 是… - 怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, uh… - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.22,0:48:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我… - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, when I… - Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.42,0:48:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 是… - 鲍比 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no. It's… - Bobby, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.82,0:48:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信你爸一定会很快回来的 好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your dad's gonna be back soon. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.73,0:49:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他可是大块头鲍勃 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on. He's Big Bob, all right?
