Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.04,0:49:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 你有枕头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Did you get pillows?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.61,0:49:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在SUV里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the S. U. V.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.78,0:49:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在午夜前还没有回来 我们就一起去找他 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's not back by midnight, we'll both go looking for him. Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.28,0:49:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Deal. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.58,0:49:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好好休息 - 晚安 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get some rest, man. - Good night, Bobby.
