Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.93,0:51:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.20,0:51:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.64,0:51:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.41,0:51:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.47,0:51:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.54,0:52:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽？过来 好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beasty? Come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.25,0:52:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.48,0:52:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大家起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Guys! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.31,0:52:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天！怎么… - 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, good God. What… - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.88,0:52:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 什么事 鲍比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby. - What is it, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.72,0:52:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里有…有不知道什么东西 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, something… something is going on around here, okay? - What is it?
