Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.17,0:53:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美女死了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beauty's dead. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.50,0:53:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了她 她象是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found her, and, uh, she was, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.74,0:53:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被人开了膛 - 开膛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It looked like somebody cut her open, you know? - Cut her open?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.38,0:53:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我刚才也没有说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and l-I didn't want to say anything…
