Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.43,0:53:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在这 锁上车门 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, you lock the car, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.97,0:53:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 我们会弄清楚怎么回事 告诉我你在哪看到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, man. We're gonna check this out. Now where did you see this?
