Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.88,0:53:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.88,0:53:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 我们不知道是怎么回事 - 是鲍勃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. We don't know what that is. - It's Bob!
