Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.69,0:57:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的鲍勃！不是我的鲍勃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my Bob! It's not my Bob!
