Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.35,1:01:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.05,1:02:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
