Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.81,1:04:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！把灯打开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Turn the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.91,1:05:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯打开 把灯打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the lights on. Turn the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.48,1:05:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说了他会回来！- 嘘！安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He said he's coming back! - Shh! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.75,1:05:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了他会回来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he's coming back for me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.59,1:05:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们！是他们！是他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them! It's them! It's them!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.50,1:05:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,风镜？风镜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goggle? Goggle?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.89,1:06:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,风镜？你收到了吗 风镜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goggle? You copy, Goggle?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.29,1:06:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,风镜在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Goggle?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.33,1:06:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他留在那里监视他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stayed back there. He's keeping an eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.03,1:06:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我告诉过你 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.54,1:06:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你应该把他们杀光！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, you've gotta kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.43,1:06:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,野兽！野兽！你还活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beast! Beast! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.46,1:06:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好孩子！好孩子好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good boy. Good boy. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.60,1:07:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好孩子 - 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good boy. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.70,1:07:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,丘比特要杀光他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter's going to finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.44,1:07:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要杀我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.61,1:07:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要这么做？你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this? You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.88,1:07:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的孩子还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me back my baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.02,1:07:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要我们什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.89,1:07:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.49,1:07:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的小女孩还给我 你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me back my little girl. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.94,1:07:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.25,1:07:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩下多少子弹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many bullets do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.25,1:07:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个半弹夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clip and a half.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.05,1:07:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.17,1:08:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走哪边 野兽？哪条路？快 跟着血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way, Beast? Which way? Come on. Follow the trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.25,1:08:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, big guy. I hope you're not afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.42,1:09:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你可不是害怕黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, big guy. I hope you're not afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.99,1:09:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪 孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,往哪走 野兽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way, Beast?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.98,1:11:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.39,1:11:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.39,1:11:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我跟着血迹走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I followed the blood trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.12,1:11:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了一个地方象是什么小镇 鲍比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It leads to a town or something out here. Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.79,1:12:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢？也许有人会听到我们的呼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows? Maybe someone heard our calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.79,1:12:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会听到我们的呼叫 布伦达！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's gonna hear the fucking calls, Brenda!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.63,1:13:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能看到这混蛋沙漠里的烟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's gonna see the goddamn smoke in this goddamn desert!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.16,1:13:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这个他妈的… 妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the middle of freakir… Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.63,1:13:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.91,1:13:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.62,1:13:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.86,1:13:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.13,1:16:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好狗狗 呆着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good dog. Stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.03,1:18:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你推她了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you push her? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.60,1:18:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把家具砸烂了？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you destroy the furniture? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.73,1:18:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管她叫大篷车垃圾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call her trailer park trash?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.31,1:18:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你是说你还… - 我还爱着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, now, you're saying you still… - I'm still in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.45,1:18:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 但是…你说你珍惜婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but… So, you said you treasured the marriage…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.88,1:18:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就在结婚两周后 决定离婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wanted to end it two weeks after you got into it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.22,1:18:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想结束这段婚姻 是因为我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to end it because I have…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.29,1:18:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有种感觉就是 我们过不到一块去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling that things werert gonna work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.89,1:18:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本就不跟我合作 我想训练她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasrt working as a team player with me, and I tried coaching her…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.60,1:18:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么训练她的？- 我就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What were you doing coaching her? - Well, I tried to show…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.80,1:18:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是你的孩子吗？- 不 不是 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she your child? - No, she's not my child, but she…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.94,1:18:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我吃晚饭 吃意大利面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted me to eat dinner… spaghetti…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.07,1:18:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在面条凉了前就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted to do it before it got cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.94,1:19:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心她的头 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch her head, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.30,1:23:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪？她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my daughter? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.61,1:23:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.91,1:23:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.38,1:23:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有离开这里一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.52,1:24:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我们这些家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people asked our families…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.06,1:24:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开我们的镇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To leave their town…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.23,1:24:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们毁掉了我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you destroyed our homes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.97,1:24:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就到了矿井\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went into the mines.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又引爆炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set off your bombs…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.48,1:24:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一切都烧成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And turned everything to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.81,1:24:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们让我们变成这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made us what we've become.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.52,1:24:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,梆！梆！梆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom. Boom. Boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.69,1:24:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.19,1:24:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么让你这么高兴的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.20,1:24:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's breakfast time!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.51,1:28:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.55,1:28:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「请不要杀我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Please don't kill me."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.05,1:29:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请不要杀我 - 「请不要杀我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please don't kill me. - "Please don't kill me."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.05,1:30:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜥蜴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.55,1:30:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把孩子杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.74,1:31:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby. Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.23,1:32:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比 你让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.40,1:32:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说让开 马上让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said get. Now, get!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.58,1:32:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你要和我们一起玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister, would you play with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.74,1:32:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.26,1:32:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.60,1:33:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.47,1:33:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.08,1:33:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.85,1:33:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.06,1:33:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 来 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.29,1:33:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 布伦达！- 鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Brenda. - Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.49,1:33:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我 跟着我 跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. Stay with me. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.00,1:33:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 一切会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.94,1:33:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.87,1:33:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 请一定小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Please? Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.22,1:34:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.66,1:34:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出来 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out, you motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.67,1:34:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 只是个风滚草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look. It's just a tumbleweed. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.01,1:34:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们回车里去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go back to the trailer. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.08,1:34:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.79,1:34:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.89,1:34:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天！- 她不见了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.03,1:34:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不见了！不见了！布伦达！布伦达！快去车里准备好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fucking gone! She's gone! Brenda! Brenda! Go get the trailer ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.47,1:34:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布伦达 去准备… - 妈妈在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brenda, go get the… - Where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.47,1:34:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去车里准备 好不好？- 妈妈在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go get the trailer ready. Okay? - Where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.94,1:34:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈在哪？- 听我说 你现在要去车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Mom? - Listen to me. I need you to go get the trailer.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.41,1:34:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后按我们商量的来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go in, do what we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.49,1:36:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！从窗走！从窗走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Get the window! Get the window!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.73,1:36:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗户卡住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.30,1:36:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃！救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob! Help me! Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.72,1:36:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快快快！快出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go, go, go, go, go, go! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.82,1:38:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.73,1:39:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.63,1:39:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.21,1:39:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.81,1:39:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比！回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby! Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.52,1:39:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小骚货！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.23,1:39:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把孩子给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.15,1:42:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.80,1:43:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.75,1:43:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 老天！看！是鲍勃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Look! Bobby!
